oni dedicate ai Mondiali 2026, tra cui Live Activities e Apple News.\",\"categoryName\":\"Applicazioni\",\"categorySlug\":\"applicazioni\",\"categoryId\":13,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/Apple-Sports-Feature-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Apple-Sports-Feature\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":0,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14936,\"date\":\"2026-05-16T12:00:31+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-16T09:52:36+00:00\",\"slug\":\"iphone-17-pro-piu-veloce-ricarica-test-cnet\",\"title\":\"iPhone 17 Pro: il più veloce in ricarica secondo un test CNET\",\"excerpt\":\"Nel test di laboratorio CNET su 33 smartphone, l’iPhone 17 Pro è risultato il telefono con ricarica più rapida complessiva. In wired domina invece il Galaxy S26 Ultra.\",\"categoryName\":\"iPhone\",\"categorySlug\":\"iphone\",\"categoryId\":4,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/iPhone-17-Pro-USB-C-Port-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"iPhone-17-Pro-USB-C-Port\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14906,\"date\":\"2026-05-15T15:30:42+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-15T06:56:06+00:00\",\"slug\":\"oled-ipad-mini-data-uscita-prezzo-cosa-aspettarsi\",\"title\":\"OLED iPad mini: data di uscita, prezzo e cosa aspettarsi\",\"excerpt\":\"Secondo i rumor, Apple sarebbe vicina a lanciare l’iPad mini di nuova generazione con chip A19 Pro e display OLED, oltre a un design più resistente all’acqua.\",\"categoryName\":\"iPad\",\"categorySlug\":\"ipad\",\"categoryId\":10,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/ipad-mini-7-b